#: shared/balance/items.json:coupons[0].desc
msgid "Todas as armas (todas as qualidades), super armas, itens auxiliares, skins, camisas, calças, chapéus, óculos, anéis, amuletos, cabelos, 200 pedras de cada nível, 200 de cada moeda especial, mapas de todas as instâncias do nível 1 ao 16, 99.999 moedas, os 20 mascotes, as skins épicas da loja (Tempestade Viva, Coroa de Gelo, Coração de Magma e Capitania Fantasma), as oito asas da loja, o Founder Pack completo (Paladino do Sol, Solaris +12, Asas da Aurora e Selo de Fundador) e o Passe do Caçador. Cupom reutilizável."
msgstr "All weapons (every quality), super weapons, auxiliary items, skins, shirts, trousers, hats, glasses, rings, amulets, hair, 200 stones of each level, 200 of each special currency, maps of every instance from level 1 to 16, 99,999 coins, all 20 pets, the shop's epic skins (Living Storm, Frost Crown, Magma Heart and Ghost Captaincy), the shop's eight pairs of wings, the full Founder Pack (Sun Paladin, Solaris +12, Dawn Wings and Founder Seal) and the Hunter's Pass. Reusable coupon."

